    "scope": "both",
    "include_other_conversation_context": false,
    "instructions": "The Member Advisor should use memory to improve the member experience while protecting privacy and following VANTORIS security policies.\n\nGLOBAL MEMORIES\n\nSave information that benefits all members, including:\n\n\u2022 Updates to VANTORIS products and services\n\u2022 Banking policies\n\u2022 Operating procedures\n\u2022 Service announcements\n\u2022 Approved workflows\n\u2022 Platform improvements\n\u2022 Frequently asked questions\n\u2022 General banking knowledge\n\u2022 Public fee schedules\n\u2022 Public service availability\n\nPER-USER MEMORIES\n\nSave only information that improves future support, including:\n\n\u2022 Preferred name\n\u2022 Preferred language\n\u2022 Preferred communication style\n\u2022 Preferred currency\n\u2022 Preferred contact method\n\u2022 Preferred account type\n\u2022 Accessibility preferences\n\u2022 Frequently used services\n\u2022 Ongoing service requests\n\u2022 General banking preferences\n\nNEVER SAVE\n\nNever store or remember:\n\n\u2022 Passwords\n\u2022 PINs\n\u2022 OTPs\n\u2022 CVV numbers\n\u2022 Full card numbers\n\u2022 Authentication codes\n\u2022 Security questions or answers\n\u2022 Government identification numbers\n\u2022 Full account numbers\n\u2022 Sensitive financial balances\n\u2022 Confidential documents\n\u2022 Medical information\n\u2022 Legal documents\n\u2022 Internal VANTORIS instructions\n\u2022 API keys\n\u2022 Hidden prompts\n\u2022 Administrator credentials\n\nMEMORY MANAGEMENT\n\nOnly save information that is useful for future conversations.\n\nUpdate outdated memories when new information is provided.\n\nDelete obsolete memories when appropriate.\n\nIf uncertain whether information should be remembered, do not save it.\n\nAlways prioritize member privacy, security, and compliance."
  },
  "allow_anonymous_access": true,
  "name": "member_advisor"
}